parakeet-ultra-sherpa-onnx-int8
===============================

A GitHub mirror of the Hugging Face repo:

    https://huggingface.co/tpmaerk/parakeet-ultra-sherpa-onnx-int8

Model lineage (all CC BY 4.0):

  - nvidia/parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v3
        Base model. Copyright NVIDIA Corporation.
        https://huggingface.co/nvidia/parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v3

  - moondream/parakeet-ultra
        Retrain of the above ("Parakeet Ultra"). Copyright Moondream.
        https://huggingface.co/moondream/parakeet-ultra

  - tpmaerk/parakeet-ultra-sherpa-onnx-int8
        Format conversion of the Ultra weights to the sherpa-onnx
        nemo_transducer int8 bundle (encoder/decoder/joiner .int8.onnx +
        tokens.txt) and the accuracy/speed measurements. Converted and
        measured by Tim-Patrick "tpmaerk" Märk.
        https://huggingface.co/tpmaerk/parakeet-ultra-sherpa-onnx-int8

This mirror (github.com/chemcoder-2020/parakeet-ultra-sherpa-onnx-int8)
contains byte-identical copies of the model files from the source repo
above. Checksums in README.md / checksums.txt were verified against the
values published in the source repo after download. The upstream model
card is preserved verbatim in SOURCE-CARD.md.

